<title>USA: Blonder Tongue says wins court ruling.</title>
<headline>Blonder Tongue says wins court ruling.</headline>
<dateline>OLD BRIDGE, N.J. 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Blonder Tongue Laboratories Inc said Thursday a U.S. court denied a motion for default judgment filed by Scientific-Atlanta Inc relating to that company's pending patent infringement suit against Blonder.</p>
<p>Blonder said the judgments were entered May 8 in the U.S. District Court for the Northern District of Georgia.</p>
<p>Blonder said the patent suit relates to its videomask signal interdiction product.</p>
<p>Scientific-Atlanta could not immediately be reached for comment.</p>
</text>
